    "detailed_description": "Embark on a spooky adventure through the realm of the dead!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834930/extras/4a9574bf0922a5caed9a7e7be7cda9b0.poster.avif?t=1732827309\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834930/extras/4a9574bf0922a5caed9a7e7be7cda9b0.webm?t=1732827309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Ravva and the Netherworld Train is a pixel-art adventure game where you play as Ravva, a young summoner, and their 4 companions! Each has unique powers to overcome obstacles while also giving the player different options to proceed, but that's not all. This time, you can also fuse Ravva with each companion, resulting in whole new creatures to play with! Explore the underworld with many new possibilities!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>In this adventure, young Ravva will need to go further than they've ever been: The Netherworld. After their father goes missing, Ravva follows the clues and finds out that he is lost in the land of the dead! But how do you get there? Why he was taken there? That's something our brave hero will have to find out!<br><br>[Work in progress]",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on a spooky adventure through the realm of the dead!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834930/extras/4a9574bf0922a5caed9a7e7be7cda9b0.poster.avif?t=1732827309\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834930/extras/4a9574bf0922a5caed9a7e7be7cda9b0.webm?t=1732827309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Ravva and the Netherworld Train is a pixel-art adventure game where you play as Ravva, a young summoner, and their 4 companions! Each has unique powers to overcome obstacles while also giving the player different options to proceed, but that's not all. This time, you can also fuse Ravva with each companion, resulting in whole new creatures to play with! Explore the underworld with many new possibilities!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>In this adventure, young Ravva will need to go further than they've ever been: The Netherworld. After their father goes missing, Ravva follows the clues and finds out that he is lost in the land of the dead! But how do you get there? Why he was taken there? That's something our brave hero will have to find out!<br><br>[Work in progress]",
